CLAIMS[1]=('C2',('Sensory-specific learning and cross-output transfer can coexist.','感觉特异学习与跨输出迁移能够并存。'),('E17 already integrates sensory-specific memories; E28 establishes multiple timescales; transfer studies constrain the output axis.','E17已整合感觉特异记忆，E28确立多时间尺度；迁移研究约束输出轴。'),('The new fixed-readout mixed-state construction changes delay ratios and directly refutes ratio invariance as a general sharing test.','新增固定读出混合状态构造产生变化的延迟比例，直接反驳其作为普遍共享检验。'),('Constant ratios require effectively one-dimensional input trajectories. Common temporal modes can have separate neural copies.','比例恒定要求有效一维输入轨迹；共同时间模式可有分别神经副本。'),('Test joint temporal recurrences and held-out histories, retaining output-specific competitors (R6).','检验联合时间递推及留出历史，保留输出特异竞争模型（R6）。'))
CLAIMS[7]=('C8',('Independent observation constraints can resolve specific factor contrasts.','独立观测约束能够解析特定因子对比。'),('Active/passive public data establish report-dependent changes; measured loadings can supply independent constraints.','公开主动/被动数据确立依赖报告的变化；实测载荷能够提供独立约束。'),('Update-sensitive reports exactly mimic input changes under the selective-report model. Common-mode dynamics admit separate copies.','更新敏感报告在选择性报告模型中精确伪装成输入变化；共同模式动力学允许分别副本。'),('Loading independence and cross-context transport must be measured. Cross-study motion data do not include these reports.','载荷独立性及跨情境迁移须测量；跨研究运动数据缺少这些报告。'),('Estimate the report model, propagate calibration uncertainty, then test frozen joint predictions; retain compatible factors when rank or recovery fails.','估计报告模型，传播校准不确定性，再检验冻结联合预测；秩或恢复不足时保留兼容因子。'))
REMOVALS=[('Independent delays','独立延迟','Removing delays leaves temporal mixtures unconstrained. Fixed mixed readout can change output ratios; use held-out recurrences.','删除延迟使时间混合缺少约束。固定混合读出也能改变输出比例，应检验留出递推。'),('A second control output','第二控制输出','A single output cannot test common versus output-specific temporal modes.','单输出无法检验共同与输出特异时间模式。'),('Independent report-loading constraints','独立报告载荷约束','With free cross-loadings, input and update contrasts form an exact continuum even when motor and report changes are measured.','交叉载荷自由时，即使测量运动及报告变化，输入和更新仍形成精确连续等价集合。'),('Crossed training/test cues','训练/测试线索交叉','Matched cues alone confound training-associated and expression-associated effects; first probes under crossed cues supply the contrast.','仅匹配线索会混淆训练相关及表达相关效应；交叉线索下首次探针提供对比。'),('Source-only tuning','仅来源内调参','Selecting penalties or modes on target post-exposure data converts external prediction into model development.','用目标暴露后数据选正则或模式，会把外部预测变成模型开发。'),('Joint residual sampling','联合残差采样','Independent channel or time sampling changes the noise geometry and can inflate recovery; preserve paired temporal blocks.','独立抽取通道或时间会改变噪声结构并可能抬高恢复率，应保留配对时间块。')]
